# Step Count IoT Watch

## Project Overview

This project implements a step tracking IoT device using the LilyGo T-Watch 2020 V3. The device counts steps throughout the day, stores step history, and synchronizes data to a Firebase cloud database, enabling a competitive step leaderboard accessible via a web interface.

