## Hardware

The project utilizes the LilyGo T-Watch 2020 V3, which includes:
- ESP32 microcontroller
- 1.54" TFT touch display (240x240 resolution)
- BMA423 3-axis accelerometer with step counting capability
- PCF8563 real-time clock
- AXP202 power management IC
- 190mAh LiPo battery

The BMA423 accelerometer provides built-in step detection functionality, making it ideal for this application. The touch screen allows for an intuitive user interface with swipe gestures for navigation.

